---
kind: lore
id: letters
title: Notes under the door
---

// (0.27) Monday evening after the festival: everyone you warmed to but did not
// float a lantern with leaves a note. `for="kind:suitor"` presents the beat
// once for each suitor whose `when` holds, in member order, with that suitor
// as occasion.target (slotStart is an untargeted select: sequence occasion).
<beat id="note" on="slotStart" for="kind:suitor" title="A note under the door" when="run.day == 8 && run.slot == 'evening' && run.route != occasion.target && run.aff[occasion.target] >= 3 && !holds('locked', [occasion.target])">
  @narrator: A folded note under the door, in {{occasion.target}}'s handwriting.
  <match on="occasion.target">
    <when is="ren">
      @ren{vo emotion="stern"}: For the record: I was not waiting on the jetty. I was supervising it. — R.A.
    </when>
    <when is="mika">
      @mika{vo emotion="happy"}: Ran past your window this morning. It was dark. Light it, okay? For me. — M
    </when>
    <when is="soren">
      @soren{vo emotion="shy"}: I drew the corner of the book anyway. It's you, from the back. I hope that's allowed.
    </when>
    <when is="kai">
      @kai{vo emotion="smirk"}: The piano's got five notes now. Don't make it weird.
    </when>
  </match>
</beat>
